12
Write a query to display the LOC and average salary of each location.
(Scalar Sub Query)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
sql> SELECT LOC,
     (
         SELECT AVG(SAL)
         FROM EMP
         WHERE EMP.DEPTNO = DEPT.DEPTNO
     ) AS AVG_SAL
     FROM DEPT;

Output:
-------

LOC         AVG_SAL
----------  --------
NEW YORK    2916.67
DALLAS      2175.00
CHICAGO     1566.67
BOSTON
